17:| D8  | Git                     | `git init` (folder isn't a repo), needed by Husky                                                                            | Husky prerequisite                                                                                              |
23:### Yarn Berry gotchas the plan accounts for
25:- Yarn 2+ **does not run `pre*`/`post*` hooks on user scripts**, so there is no `prestart`. `start` chains `yarn build &&` explicitly.
26:- Yarn 2+ **does not run `prepare`**, so Husky installs via `"postinstall": "husky"`. Docker builds set `HUSKY=0` so the hook install doesn't fail without `.git`.
28:## 2. Target layout
39:│   ├── layouts/
40:│   │   └── MainLayout.tsx         # <Outlet/> in Suspense; slot for future <Navbar/>
44:│   │   ├── ui/                    # Tailwind primitives (Button, Card)
