118:| **gauge**       | none                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              | atlas, harbor done | Reports pass/fail for `yarn install --immutable`, `lint`, `typecheck`, `build`, chunk list, `docker build` (skipped if Docker absent), bad-commit blocked |
